{"message":"Calculating net change in asset retirement liability for fiscal 2003 as ending balance minus beginning balance: $7.2M - $5.5M = $1.7M. This also equals additional obligations recognized ($0.5M) plus accretion recognized ($1.2M).","tool":"calculate","arguments":{"expression":"7.2 - 5.5","variables":{"ending_balance":{"value":"7.2","source":"source:t3c1n0","unit":"millions"},"beginning_balance":{"value":"5.5","source":"source:t0c1n0","unit":"millions"}},"sources":{"ending_balance":"source:t3c1n0","beginning_balance":"source:t0c1n0"}}}